      "text": "Mo i Rana Airport, R\u00f8ssvoll\nMo i Rana Airport , R\u00f8ssvoll ( Mo i Rana lufthavn , R\u00f8ssvoll ) is a regional airport serving the town of Mo i Rana in the municipality of Rana in Nordland county , Norway . The airport is located about 10 km outside the town in the village of R\u00f8ssvoll . In 2014 Mo i Rana Airport served 104,474 passengers . It is operated by Avinor ."
