      "end": 493,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Mo Industrial Park\nThis led to the decision to build an iron mill in Mo i Rana . Norwegian Iron Work was producing steel for the country from 1947 until 1988 , when the company was divided into several new companies . The iron mill had a significant impact on the town development of Mo i Rana . In 1955 , the city 's population had grown from 2,000 to 20,000 . In 2007 , the park housed 130 companies . It is still important for the local society , giving work to approximately 2,000 people ."
