      "text": "Mo i Rana Station\nMo i Rana Station ( Mo i Rana stasjon ) is a railway station located in the town of Mo i Rana in the municipality of Rana , in Nordland county , Norway . The station is located along the Nordland Line and has been in operation since 1942 . Since 10 January 1943 , Norsk Spisevognselskap has operated a restaurant at the station ."
